{"id":"n55297-2-7","stage":5,"title":"무르다 · 松软","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55297-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 병원에 갔더니 위염이 심하대.","zh":"今天去医院，医生说我的胃炎很严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"갔더니","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔더니","audio":"/audio/5f705b64c8e27a99e60e.mp3"}},{"text":"위염이","meaning":"胃炎","explanation":"위염：胃炎；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"위염","audio":"/audio/25f98a3cf6275e41a899.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69638","senseId":"1","lemma":"위염","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위염이","audio":"/audio/12051e8b26c6a5548c88.mp3"}},{"text":"심하대.","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심하대","audio":"/audio/e4ecd2685dab659351c0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"25f98a3cf6275e41","term":"위염","zh":"胃炎","audio":"/audio/25f98a3cf6275e41a899.mp3","entryId":"69638","definition":"在胃部产生的炎症；或指因此引发的病。","pronunciation":["위염"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b93ee844ee89ae73bae2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55297-2-7-2","ko":"그래? 그럼 한동안은 죽같이 무른 음식을 먹어야겠다.","zh":"是吗？那你这阵子得吃粥之类软和的食物了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"한동안은","meaning":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","explanation":"한동안：一度，一时，一阵子，长时间；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"한동안","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72432","senseId":"1","lemma":"한동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한동안은","audio":"/audio/322986bb20a623861645.mp3"}},{"text":"죽같이","meaning":"粥","explanation":"죽：粥；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"죽","audio":"/audio/3bd31af8b11badee4ccb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91773","senseId":"1","lemma":"죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죽같이","audio":"/audio/bc7e851b35ec6cd5fd12.mp3"}},{"text":"무른","meaning":"松软","explanation":"무르다：松软；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"무르다","audio":"/audio/c26688ed6e3c9a06417f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55297","senseId":"2","lemma":"무르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무른","audio":"/audio/f2c4b41621a032d9f44b.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어야겠다.","meaning":"吃，收","explanation":"먹다：吃，收；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"16","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어야겠다","audio":"/audio/a8ee88c464c128b9acfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"9efbe5bbba69a9d5","term":"한동안","zh":"一度，一时，一阵子，长时间","audio":"/audio/9efbe5bbba69a9d59231.mp3","entryId":"72432","definition":"挺长的一段时间。","pronunciation":["한동안"]},{"id":"3bd31af8b11badee","term":"죽","zh":"粥","audio":"/audio/3bd31af8b11badee4ccb.mp3","entryId":"91773","definition":"用大米或糯米等粮食长时间煮成的软烂的食物。","pronunciation":["죽"]},{"id":"c26688ed6e3c9a06","term":"무르다","zh":"松软","audio":"/audio/c26688ed6e3c9a06417f.mp3","entryId":"55297","definition":"水分多而软乎乎。","pronunciation":["무르다"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"食物，食品","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"可供人们吃喝的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃，收","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"需要或花费钱财或物品。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/54fe50329212b2ef72a3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55297","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？那你这阵子得吃粥之类软和的食物了。","可恶，画都洇开了。","今天去医院，医生说我的胃炎很严重。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是吗？那你这阵子得吃粥之类软和的食物了。","今天去医院，医生说我的胃炎很严重。","可恶，画都洇开了。"],"answer":0}]}
